  m_Name: Evento_SobrecargaDaRede5GIoT
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Sobrecarga da Rede 5G/IoT
  _titleEn: 5G/IoT Network Overload
  _category: 1
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Milh\xF5es de aparelhos conectados aumentam o tr\xE1fego da rede e criam
    novas portas de entrada para ataques."
  _summaryEn: Millions of connected devices increase network traffic and open new
    doors for attacks.
  _realWorld: "Em 2016, a rede de rob\xF4s Mirai usou c\xE2meras e roteadores mal
    protegidos para derrubar grandes sites da internet num ataque de nega\xE7\xE3o
    de servi\xE7o."
  _realWorldEn: In 2016, the Mirai botnet used poorly secured cameras and routers
    to take down major websites in a denial-of-service attack.
  _tradeOffs: "Senhas padr\xE3o, aparelhos sem atualiza\xE7\xE3o e redes sem folga
    s\xE3o os pontos fracos."
  _tradeOffsEn: Default passwords, unpatched devices and networks without spare capacity
    are the weak points.
  _sources:
  - Label: Mirai (Wikipedia)
    Url: https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mirai_(malware)
